### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### 2. Get Todo Statistics (Total, Completed, Pending, Overdue, Priority & Category Breakdowns)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/todos/stats

### 3. Create Todo 1 (High Priority & Overdue Date)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fix critical database indexing bug",
  "description": "Optimize Mongoose indexes for faster query performance.",
  "priority": "high",
  "category": "Backend",
  "dueDate": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### 4. Create Todo 2 (Medium Priority)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Design responsive navigation bar",
  "description": "Implement modern Tailwind CSS navbar with mobile drawer.",
  "priority": "medium",
  "category": "Frontend",
  "dueDate": "2026-08-25T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### 5. Create Todo 3 (Low Priority & Completed)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Update project documentation",
  "description": "Write comprehensive README with API specifications.",
  "completed": true,
  "priority": "low",
  "category": "Documentation"
}

### 6. Get All Todos
GET http://localhost:5000/api/todos

### 7. Filter Todos by Category, Priority & Completed Status
GET http://localhost:5000/api/todos?category=Backend&priority=high&completed=false

### 8. Search Todos by Title Keyword
GET http://localhost:5000/api/todos?search=navigation

### 9. Sort Todos by Priority (High -> Medium -> Low)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/todos?sortBy=priority&order=desc

### 10. Sort Todos by Due Date (Ascending)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/todos?sortBy=dueDate&order=asc

### 11. Toggle Todo Completed Status (Replace {id} with real Mongo ID)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/todos/65d123456789abcdef012345/toggle

### 12. Delete Todo by ID (Replace {id} with real Mongo ID)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/todos/65d123456789abcdef012345
